title: "Cyber-Resilient Smart Microgrid Cyber-Physical System"
type: software
version: "0.2.0"
authors:
  - name: "Hira Khyzer"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hirakhyzer/cyber-resilient-smart-microgrid-cps"
abstract: "Defensive research platform for smart-microgrid cyber resilience using DER models, battery storage, digital twins, synthetic cyber/fault injection, telemetry-grounded state estimation, uncertainty-aware and temporal anomaly evidence, trust scoring, resilient energy management, and multi-seed cyber-physical experiments."
keywords:
  - cyber-physical systems
  - smart microgrid
  - distributed energy resources
  - digital twin
  - cybersecurity
  - resilient control
  - state estimation
  - replay detection
